{
  "version": 1,
  "text": "You have chosen a black off-the-shoulder mini dress, brown suede knee-high boots with a block heel, and beige heeled mules in the photos for #68·11, but the data says you want boots. You also picked a sand headband with gold-set crystals, gold bee and 'J'ADIOR' earrings, and a tan suede tote with a smaller pouch attached. Your look will be all about contrast: the deep black of the dress against the warm brown of the boots and the soft beige of the bag and headband. The gold in your jewelry ties the whole thing together, catching the light as you move.",
  "how_to_wear": ["Tuck your hair back so the headband sits right on your forehead and the crystals catch the club lights.", "Wear the earrings close to your face; let the bee swing with every dance move and let 'J'ADIOR' sit against your collarbone.", "Carry the tote over one shoulder, letting the pouch hang free—it’s a statement piece that adds weight to your silhouette without bulk."],
  "wrong_photos": [
    {
      "n": "#68·11"
    }
  ],
  "about_items": [
    {
      "n": "#209·29",
      "text": "A sleek black mini dress with an off-the-shoulder neckline and long sleeves, cut close to the body. The fabric is smooth and matte, hugging your hips and ending mid-thigh for a bold, modern line."
    },
    {
      "n": "#68·11",
      "text": "Brown suede knee-high boots with a block heel and pointed toe. The material is soft and slouches slightly at the calf, giving a relaxed yet elegant feel—though the photos show them on bare legs, they’re meant to be worn with your black dress."
    },
    {
      "n": "#378·16",
      "text": "A wide sand-colored velvet headband lined with gold-set crystals that shift from clear to warm amber. It sits high on your head, framing your face and adding a touch of sparkle without overwhelming your look."
    },
    {
      "n": "#212·35",
      "text": "A pair of gold-toned stud earrings—one shaped like a delicate bee, the other spelling ‘J’ADIOR’ in bold lettering. Both are lightweight and sit just below your earlobes, catching attention without dragging down your neckline."
    },
    {
      "n": "#19·22",
      "text": "A slouchy tan suede tote with a drawstring pouch attached to the front. The main compartment is open and spacious, while the smaller pouch adds visual interest and a hint of playfulness to your ensemble."
    }
  ],
